00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:40.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it had a really sort of
illustrious history,

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:41.961 line:92%
and they published their friends

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:43.029 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they actually
made the books,

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:46.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it was an amazing
and very admirable endeavor.

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.868 size:88% position:44%
And then it sort of went
through a fallow period.

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:52.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, a few years ago,
