00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:22.068 line:92%
-Yeah, so, that's the part.

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:23.636 size:78% position:39%
You know, I would say
I'm a reader, too,

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:26.239
