00:03:35.481 --> 00:03:37.150 size:88% position:44% line:92%
It's just a different --

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
All sorts of
other considerations

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:42.655 size:81% position:41%
