00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:07.380
And it's an
amazing, important debut novel.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:11.484
And it's a thrill, and for
a reader, it's heaven on Earth.

00:04:11.484 --> 00:04:12.385 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Well, that's fantastic.

00:04:12.385 --> 00:04:14.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
